  "description": "ADUKAO crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C90 H98 N8 O32 Tb4 Zn2 2+,4(C1 H4 O1),2(N1 O3 1-). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Zn1 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Tb1B (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2B (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Zn1B (Zn) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.583-3.908 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.80-122.27°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C95H118Tb4N10O43Zn2. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
